0,Karenic languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karenic_languages,"They are of unclear affiliation within the Sino-Tibetan languages. The Karen languages are written using the Karen script. The three main branches are Sgaw, Pwo and Pa'O.","Karen, Pwo Eastern",Sino-Tibetan
