7,(PDF) Karen and surrounding languages,https://www.researchgate.net/publication/350687695_Karen_and_surrounding_languages,The Christian Pwo Karen Script is used as the writing system for Western Pwo Karen. This script was originally created by Baptist missionaries for Eastern Pwo Karen. Western Pwo Karen and Eastern Pwo Karen differ considerably in terms of phonology.,"Karen, Pwo Eastern",Sino-Tibetan
8,KAREN – Languages Remote,https://languagesremote.com.au/karen/,"The Karen languages, members of the Tibeto-Burman group of the Sino-Tibetan language family, consist of three mutually unintelligible branches: Sgaw, Eastern Pwo, and Western Pwo.","Karen, Pwo Eastern",Sino-Tibetan
